detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Secret Cats - Haunted Mansion&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in &quot;Secret Cats - Haunted Mansion&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discovery. Will you find all the hidden cats? Let the hunt begin!</p>","developers":["Hidden Cats"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284640/b1f1af84e74b05874039c97c949ac4c95ce45aa0/header.jpg?t=1771621417","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b